Period material
---------------

Corel Linux OS 1.2 is the target. Its own sources - the kernel,
KDE 1.1, sndconfig, the installer - were read to understand what
the system does and what a package must fit into. Corel
Corporation, 1999-2000.

The Kernel that started this project rests on a USB backport patch for 2.2.16
(usb-2.4.0-test2-pre2-for-2.2.16-v3), published by a SUSE developer
whose page is now reachable only through the Internet Archive:
https://web.archive.org/web/20010124002200/http://www.suse.cz/development/usb-backport/


